OL,3,GNEWSAFirst osprey chicks in 200 years
OL,4,Areported in county
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pair of birds once driven to the
OL,7,Fbrink of extinction could have produced
OL,8,Fthe county's first chicks for at least
OL,9,F200 years.
OL,11,FA breeding pair of ospreys had been
OL,12,Freported in Herefordshire, nesting in
OL,13,Fan oak tree near the River Wye close to
OL,14,Fthe Powys border where they had raised
OL,15,Fthree chicks to fledging.
OL,17,F"It's just fantastic news," said Toby
OL,18,FFountain of Herefordshire Wildlife
OL,19,FTrust.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
